      "text": "ReceiptOCR\n\nApprove your email change\n\nWe got a request to change the email for your ReceiptOCR account from {{currentEmail}} to {{newEmail}}. Approve it below, then open the link we send to the new address. You'll keep signing in with this address until both steps are done.\n\nApprove email change:\n{{url}}\n\nThis link expires in {{expiry}}.\n\nDidn't ask for this? Don't open the link. Your address stays the same. Someone may have access to your account, so reset your password ({{resetUrl}}) and contact us at {{supportEmail}}.\n\n--\nYou're receiving this because this is the sign-in address of a ReceiptOCR account.\nQuestions? Reply to this email or write to {{supportEmail}}.\nReceiptOCR · {{appOrigin}} · Privacy: {{appOrigin}}/privacy"
